# wear/woman/dress_hang: the dress's skirt to the ankles with A3's apron; the hem sways by whole rows (sway 5), widens on contact frames
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY); A3's pixels are the reference (docs/ref/style_a3). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person woman
body woman
role garment dress
layer hangFront
anchor hip
keys hang
sway 5
# GARB-W (wave 2): the kneel at five rows (the kneel posture's bob 5 and the fall's buckle), the floor (cross-legged, the
# apron in front) and ride (astride: a panel over each leg) keys for POSES-B's postures; A3's own views are unchanged

